.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.RDataTmp*
.RDataTmp*.*
.Ruserdata
*.RData
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Nested renv debris created when knitting from inside writeup/
# (the repo-root .Rprofile that runs renv/activate.R is tracked)
writeup/.Rprofile
writeup/renv/

# Local AI / agent files and planning notes
CLAUDE.md
MEMORY.md
